# Optional. Copy to .env for local docker-compose use.
# An HF token raises Hugging Face Hub's unauthenticated rate limit and
# speeds up model downloads (see README/Report -- every model in this task
# was pulled anonymously without one, but it's still recommended for a
# production deployment to avoid rate-limit-related cold-start failures).
HF_TOKEN=

